朗普没有专注于自己作为总司令的职责，而是满足于“建造自己的舞厅，并与娜塔莉一起在卡塔尔埃米尔赠送的显然毫无防御能力的飞行宫殿中旅行”。特朗普的回应是将奥索夫与皮威·赫尔曼进行了比较，并&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/8ietQt54Sa_tXgRfPrbNuLFoYb1PYSvJ_ANVqiWmcZ0lGicMF3gi3_nvU4Aofm-9EGFmEhqo_u8jqzgQFtL4V-mwYHnLp4MudovSt7WsYvqTye8ydL2qgo62yoKLu4MEgZ03AnKy2uEN9SgXJ41a4mKZ0IncrKR0YbiaxBTKxKwi3ny88ijiMhk8Q4dAkWp7SvisiUJWuNAdb7wuYQmnyzHWW3IIk5e_f2p1ttVnbXIhRjchno2gFsYNZyOEKpJ7QYax8ZVFaQdC1AAi6vsWqNjhddnT2cC0W3fLVbZy20c7FPZ_rErxOS636I0X00X_4VgBSPHsunbavhKL-i1J7vQ1xU7wWe6ShM4nqvb8BMOuGrMX4pC0v0hndA/OXGcvGlvH43VstOSBjLTWnW3jNeEc7BQ/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="白宫就CNN记者向特朗普提问发起人身攻击"&gt;斥责了一名询问这位参议员言论的 CNN 记者&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;据报道，周二，奥索夫在与亚利桑那州民主党参议员马克·凯利的一次集会上扩大了对特朗普的攻击，称特朗普是一位“ &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/lnpXuau5Vc7K_TYKNFWb0i8U76y4S0h8iyROiyxnG1ofJLKQilFi7M_TtQPWUQYMBdUfQOe71cQiOTFun7TpLRnxyby68r4nTnJfrSPNhqIPRgXszkOJXCWVt9xYl10Fv1e6FqDWdj_M9nsQRB-Og1cuzy_Wb0rrOL3l2pK90eoP3UHUGKYz5H-f8W9zUaRST7qTDJ02RPL3tHrQVeuryFDh8tcSHErfmseebmTg6FJRlYo4cTTewhI2oO9ZkgIG9n1TGkAiVYsPAiLNY5RkBsJWabx9lR7jfl5ivIbwTXs8Qpnu-XH1JkSanDBm_hjoH1A-B8S-_tsz-BQ/ws3mWxAcwrvEwO6iKZwOCVU2LoHwf5fs/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="奥索夫称特朗普为“逃避选秀的骗子总统”，加剧了他与白宫的不和美国有线电视新闻网政治"&gt;逃避选秀的骗子总统，&lt;/a&gt;他鲁莽地让我们的国家陷入了一场他不知道如何结束或获胜的​​战争”。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/2qgZJc0kPEaGaDEskWOJOhISOSiE5NjRRW3P3KUMio-Bx_CTOMH255On5tfgZGt1Lsk_maQIAHkYDqM_P3Bs-TJaoBBg0qTYZZBg2L_49k55WsM7ozy4-NFv8SZWaj9V9b4m6ertlOttGmSaCXxG3py1GiQYQB_Vq07l39O8Q_i4ew1fZcS-lEAFqk-Fg5QYYuxc_nXb4Xoauf_bYfQ8R4lE4jh1uAhIulAOwrJOu0qdtRnIcVPvcgjLQesmjNAy6QsLd-tXyGMp8yGuIH23xGMLXIZIhLyg8obZywLjXwCarjYL_su4QqCd8_3ibJb4thtkabRGcB4MtH_Y7LjcFNoriaF9501TaUs4pQ787rOPhuyjT354examTMOZ4YRV9qJf1__HunkzS8Xmi08eKgjM088KsZCpGu7D0vI78FkpGvEn1E11zFE9-p3SWYEKVcMBQrjkaAqy