之一的英国雇主越来越多地雇用具有相关技能的候选人。研究结果强调了一种转变，这种转变有望为使用新技术的公司带来收益，同时也给整个劳动力市场的工人带来干扰。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;距离总统选举还有不到两个月的时间，巴西财政部长达里奥·杜里根在接受彭博新闻社采访时表示，&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;巴西投资者&lt;/strong&gt;对政府&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/kBEn2FadOD-jcI6fOLnit0IAaR6bjUffusdHmmVOrOeIaR-8nAC-HYN_mn1VSKlKMfABYZtuzHhHLZPT95rWeU-_1TMZZsfg49oAdtsDKBjC21gGF8gnN-xEg-upz6kZBKcD7G5S4ABnbZ5ZbPUHahepyEMr5GdHt1hb1wa9Lt3LiDz1y8_HGkXOlxADMrwF3LIUQ2d3xAGdaYMgimvZqsBXT6VCsRPBe8FkFjAt_BHPUoaCE1ioSV_Vu12X-sMmDT-eV3ImZxilWR1DuQWr2PM6LzGkzUd0hCwtjAv701O_jolJ8YE1Fm6-gqLJFhsQfp8FtQUhC-q9xaHCgRmuOxCdNl87fFyMBDbO7aVa8AuKucNto2NEXozV6aZXMMQ2_ft4qFABTo3Cav2cAW9ni-Q9iast_X-kvaEYdqW5G8zFM1oAtl4yIb1SY2SXiGOk25Fp5XqMOeSjU7aXyBLHrj4c1snfl2zD13RVbDwAqgbZ5kHpIM2oaMy3V8Pi2f--4GWeQ5mvx7y7zf7RNWJv_i5EHVUrDI0yQWI1UaNa/pwEcsLPyasCk1n94lNmemgrxf_6I0XTd/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="财政部长表示，如果连任，卢拉必须解决财政问题"&gt;需要解决&lt;/a&gt;的支出轨迹存在合理的疑问。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;缅甸总统&lt;/strong&gt;敏昂莱将于莫斯科&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/YpCx2CopCNviAgqayeF278-s16TBzeF1hDFUAD3nOOUhaXzI4t6IoIaERojUmDucaRwK-lcMVE_1vfFcoJZ_R3wJoppZewvwBsU_LW7FHF2cJguVqAF7Eoz5AxO3LugvOlVkC1dXGbVHQFZhchNtjQ8nmr04P7uPXSReXALfRpYw4NtePPULnYgFuEI4ZFPF_kLnBs06ZPwXi0LedRV0JsxC_CqTeNMF7FnhR2pppDw8u4tnkX13X8gegS33iH2vYh7lqTqUUkWcycFYMfceS9xhBg-liOIDgpTvJkpvsnh23BPuI9hitKO4GBKjRFSftUTSvEgInRs3oOo5xvjqqiNjTk6J5cgM7LjPP0mQ-lOudBoqA2FsT-cz_oGsiJfBFXM-SOiozIMkr0a94DHvIGoNW7NPJVLshggrtJFFpth1jVk2vMiVZQtN4rn5EzsgxEc9XNPGVi3aH2L7GB9dqYaCYpqxyCF08qO0sMvEieMquSqS4gQQzRdyaPLUQGlUkrIeOXoAhWcZAUeAJQvINRp-yIsH04ctNnPmi8QP2qYavQ/rKfrf5MjqBx72g9AnxgQl4RwnILLftfn/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="缅甸领导人将在就任总统后首次莫斯科之行中会见普京"&gt;会见&lt;/a&gt;俄罗斯领导人弗拉基米尔·普京，这是他最近一次出国之行，旨在在有争议的选举后寻求更多人接受政府。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;table width="580"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iV2efsl880vo/v0/-1x-1.jpg" alt="Myanmar’s military chief Min Aung Hlaing arrives to deliver a speech during a ceremony to mark the country’s Armed Forces Day in Naypyidaw on March 27, 2025. Myanmar’s junta chief insisted on March 27 that a planned election will go ahead despite the country’s spiralling civil war, in a speech to thousands of soldiers and dignitaries at the annual Armed Forces Day parade. (Photo by AFP) (Photo by STR&amp;amp;#x2F;AFP via Getty Images) Photographer: STR&amp;amp;#x2F;AFP" width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="2025 年 3 月 27 日，缅甸军事总司令敏昂莱抵达内比都，在纪念该国武装部队日的仪式上发表讲话。3 月 27 日，缅甸军政府领导人在一年一度的武装部队日阅兵式上向数千名士兵和政要发表讲话时坚称，尽管该国内战不断升级，但仍将按计划进行选举。 （法新社拍摄）（STR&amp;amp;#x2F;AFP 通过 Getty Images 拍摄）摄影师：STR&amp;amp;#x2F;AFP" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iV2efsl880vo/v0/-1x-1.jpg" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;"&gt;敏昂莱去年在内比都出席武装部队日纪念仪式。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; font-style: italic;"&gt;摄影师：法新社/盖蒂图片社&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;在有报道称&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/xwqfDmi5eLT60DTVijne-K05qzH2iVuYmZgH4PXpqMxit78VT2LmGYyzuY43Erx2hVUI7cCinXItHirZKE5Bw1tiZK0B4qdD5rBhOCttlhvTQw3mB6lt9lokIC1w7U-IyPreOhPLJ-n_SNR7ellxY8bsKSQ_S5AIU-dUKo1U1wjBG4VChTAWYiJGLyCgiPJbMU0RPdMBFWtThhZxIhTFYb6zy1ZCTYh4Ibsb_EGgg1NuXyBPj7FGgu3nK_19b8KRbwcTSjdwBOoe6zaE9n7NoDaDobOfZF9fAtodvw3bPup1-SI4TfJSpy86iL6o2y_LmJqKqryAweMKhE-T9EPf14SUk87VVU8e1HaHKGXopKajiuo4K7IrW8uUKOGwPw7GC1OtfKoIMTTuwAr3TBX6oTMlLLEZAouNxVnqfsoOnUCjYfaC01MZiBFqAk1d9bbozQBvNVo5AbwDqBHe9lb-23lWoQVAoaqn